      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    remaining_payments = [5000, 5000, 5000]\n    principal = 100000\n    treasury_yield = 0.025\n    spread = 0.012\n\n    # Calculate the discount rate and present value of remaining cash flows\n    discount_rate = treasury_yield + spread\n    make_whole_price = sum(\n        payment / ((1 + discount_rate) ** (i + 1))\n        for i, payment in enumerate(remaining_payments)\n    )\n    make_whole_price += principal / ((1 + discount_rate) ** len(remaining_payments))\n\n    # Return the price rounded to the nearest whole number\n    return round(make_whole_price)\n```",
